<title>BRAZIL: BRAZIL'S COPEL H1 NET RISES VS YEAR AGO.</title>
<headline>BRAZIL'S COPEL H1 NET RISES VS YEAR AGO.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state-owned power company Companhia Paranaense de Energia (Copel) released the following first-half 1997 results.</p>
<p>			Jan-June 1997	   Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>Net		   112.4 million	   105.2 million</p>
<p>Net Revs	    605.6 million	   600 million</p>
<p>Oper Income	 130.8 million	   140.6 million</p>
<p>Pre-Tax Profit    165.9 million	   162 million</p>
<p>Note: Figures are in Brazilian reais and are not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>The company is owned by the southern state of Parana.</p>
<p>((--James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
